        "created_at": "2013-04-24T18:31:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In that case, I guess I'd swap my guesses for #8 and #10, making #8 orc and #10 human. &nbsp;I'd believe #10 as human, but #8 as orc doesn't feel much better than #10 did. &nbsp;Guess I don't know enough about orcs yet to have a good feel for their ships.</p>",
